    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "x4Ab1i",
      "x": 1310,
      "y": 0,
      "name": "Note - Admin mode tap zone",
      "width": 280,
      "height": 420,
      "content": "ADMIN MODE TAP ZONE (reminder for every screen and every Stage)\n\nWhat: an invisible frame named \"Admin tap zone (invisible)\".\nSize: 124 x 56 px.\nPosition: x 133, y 62 (top center, right under the 62 px status bar), measured inside the 390 x 844 screen frame.\nSetup: layoutPosition absolute, no fill, no stroke, last child of the frame so nothing covers it.\n\nBehaviour (HUNT.md): 5 taps within 3 seconds, then the PIN. One tap does nothing. Typing the Master code into the Code field is the alternative way in.\n\nPuzzle screen: the zone sits over the Boxes counter label. The label is also 124 px wide and starts at x 133 (256 px pill, centered, 4 px padding, 56 px button, 6 px gap).\nPlan B: the counter is hidden but the zone stays exactly where it is.\nNever visible: no outline, no hint, no test mode banner.\n\nCheck on every new Stage: zone is present, same x/y/size, and no button, ornament or text sits on top of it."
    },
