                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "We're going on a little adventure today. I've picked a few Stops for you. Somewhere that has a significant meaning for the both of us, or somewhere important. Each Stop gives you a Puzzle for the next one, and if a Puzzle has you stuck, ask for a Clue. Nobody's counting. I won't say much about where we're going. I'm just here to keep you company.",
